{"k":"de","t":"Differential Equations","cls":"12","u":"Calculus","s":[["Basics",[{"q":"Order and degree","f":"\\text{order}=\\text{highest derivative};\\quad\\text{degree}=\\text{power of the highest derivative (after making it polynomial in derivatives)}","n":"Degree is not defined if derivatives appear inside $\\sin$, $e^{(\\cdot)}$, $\\ln$ etc."},{"q":"Forming a DE","f":"n\\ \\text{arbitrary constants}\\Rightarrow\\text{differentiate } n\\ \\text{times and eliminate}","n":"Order of the DE = number of independent arbitrary constants."}]],["First-order methods",[{"q":"Variables separable","f":"\\frac{dy}{dx}=f(x)g(y)\\Rightarrow\\int\\frac{dy}{g(y)}=\\int f(x)\\,dx+C","n":"$\\frac{dy}{dx}=f(ax+by+c)$: put $v=ax+by+c$."},{"q":"Homogeneous equation","f":"\\frac{dy}{dx}=F\\left(\\frac yx\\right):\\ y=vx,\\ \\ v+x\\frac{dv}{dx}=F(v)","n":"Reducible: $\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{a_1x+b_1y+c_1}{a_2x+b_2y+c_2}$ — shift origin $x=X+h,\\ y=Y+k$ (if $\\frac{a_1}{a_2}\\ne\\frac{b_1}{b_2}$), else put $v=a_1x+b_1y$."},{"q":"Linear equation","f":"\\frac{dy}{dx}+Py=Q:\\quad\\text{IF}=e^{\\int P\\,dx},\\quad y\\cdot\\text{IF}=\\int Q\\cdot\\text{IF}\\,dx+C","d":"Multiply by $e^{\\int P}$: the left side becomes $\\frac d{dx}\\left(ye^{\\int P}\\right)$."},{"q":"Linear in $x$","f":"\\frac{dx}{dy}+Px=Q\\ (P,Q\\ \\text{functions of }y):\\ x\\cdot\\text{IF}=\\int Q\\cdot\\text{IF}\\,dy+C"},{"q":"Bernoulli's equation","f":"\\frac{dy}{dx}+Py=Qy^n:\\ \\text{put } z=y^{1-n}\\Rightarrow\\frac{dz}{dx}+(1-n)Pz=(1-n)Q"},{"q":"Exact differentials to recognise","f":"d(xy)=x\\,dy+y\\,dx,\\quad d\\!\\left(\\frac yx\\right)=\\frac{x\\,dy-y\\,dx}{x^2},\\quad d\\!\\left(\\tan^{-1}\\frac yx\\right)=\\frac{x\\,dy-y\\,dx}{x^2+y^2}","n":"$d\\left(\\ln(xy)\\right)=\\frac{x\\,dy+y\\,dx}{xy}$; $d\\left(\\frac{x^2+y^2}{2}\\right)=x\\,dx+y\\,dy$; $d\\left(\\ln\\frac yx\\right)=\\frac{x\\,dy-y\\,dx}{xy}$."},{"q":"Exact equation","f":"M\\,dx+N\\,dy=0\\ \\text{exact iff}\\ \\frac{\\partial M}{\\partial y}=\\frac{\\partial N}{\\partial x}"},{"q":"Clairaut's equation","f":"y=px+f(p),\\ p=\\tfrac{dy}{dx}:\\quad\\text{general solution } y=cx+f(c)"}]],["Applications",[{"q":"Orthogonal trajectories","f":"\\text{replace } \\frac{dy}{dx}\\ \\text{by}\\ -\\frac{dx}{dy}\\ \\text{in the DE of the family}"},{"q":"Growth and decay","f":"\\frac{dN}{dt}=kN\\Rightarrow N=N_0e^{kt}","n":"Half-life $=\\frac{\\ln2}{|k|}$. Newton's cooling: $\\frac{dT}{dt}=-k(T-T_s)$."}]],["Common results",[{"q":"Second-order with constant coefficients (for reference)","f":"y''+py'+qy=0:\\ m^2+pm+q=0;\\ \\text{distinct } m_1,m_2: y=Ae^{m_1x}+Be^{m_2x}","n":"Equal roots: $(A+Bx)e^{mx}$; complex $\\alpha\\pm i\\beta$: $e^{\\alpha x}(A\\cos\\beta x+B\\sin\\beta x)$."},{"q":"Curves with geometric conditions","f":"\\text{subtangent}=\\frac y{y'},\\ \\text{subnormal}=yy',\\ \\text{tangent intercepts: } x-\\frac y{y'},\\ y-xy'"}]]]}